10→ * Design philosophy:
11→ * - Titles always visible below thumbnail (scan-friendly)
12→ * - Video plays on hover (motion draws attention)
13→ * - Clean typography hierarchy: title → description → client
14→ * - Description first: leads with thinking, not credits
15→ * - Client as footnote: credibility signal, not headline
16→ * - No category tags - let the visuals speak
17→ */
